WEBVTT

NOTE The Conquest of the Pole (1912) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.650
[music, French cards translated]

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.750
Scientists from all over the
world, gathered in congress,
debate the best way to reach the
North Pole.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.750
Professor Maboul presents his
brilliant machine, built to
brave the ice of the Pole.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:56.000
The electric works, where
Professor Maboul built his
creation.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.500
The departure

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:35.750
The scientists who could not fit
in Professor Maboul's machine
try to join him by other means.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.250
The motor cars take on
the fearsome expedition.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:38.750
Sovereign master of the air, the
Professor sails past the
constellations and calls on the
signs of the Zodiac.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:49.250
The glorious machine
lands on the Arctic shore.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.250
The mystery of the
Pole: the snow giant

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.500
The magnetic needle, the
axis of the North Pole.

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:22.750
After the victory, the Aero Club
solemnly welcomes the triumphant
Professor Maboul.
